<title>EGYPT: Egypt buys 30,000 tonnes of U.S. yellow corn.</title>
<headline>Egypt buys 30,000 tonnes of U.S. yellow corn.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's official Holding Company for Rice and Flour Mills said on Monday it bought 30,000 tonnes of Number 2 U.S. yellow corn for $164.65 per tonne C+F.</p>
<p>Company Chairman Kamal Ghoneim said the corn would be for delivery between 1 and 10 October.</p>
<p>-- Miral Fahmy +202 578 3290/91</p>
</text>
